    <briefdescription>
<para>Resolves module dependencies and computes a safe load order. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Modules register themselves together with their dependency declarations. Calling <ref refid="classthemis_1_1modules_1_1_module_dependency_resolver_1ab8911d4b3ab1377692f18019b4f61f07" kindref="member">resolve()</ref> returns a topological ordering that guarantees every dependency is loaded before the module that depends on it. Circular dependencies and missing required dependencies are reported as errors.</para>
<para>Usage: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">ModuleDependencyResolver<sp/>resolver;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">resolver.registerModule(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;themis_base&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>{});</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">resolver.registerModule(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;themis_storage&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,<sp/>{{</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;themis_base&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">}});</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">resolver.registerModule(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;themis_query&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,<sp/><sp/><sp/>{{</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;themis_storage&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">},<sp/>{</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;themis_base&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">}});</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>result<sp/>=<sp/>resolver.resolve();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">if</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>(result.success)<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">for</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>(</highlight><highlight class="keyword">const</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal">&amp;<sp/>mod<sp/>:<sp/>result.loadOrder)<sp/>{<sp/>...<sp/>}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
